### Legend

| Color | Role | Pages |
|-------|------|-------|
| 🔵 Blue | **Public / Guest** | `/login`, `/register`, `/status`, `/dashboard`, `/submit`, `/my-reports`, `/account` |
| 🟠 Orange | **Cleaner** | `/cleaner/tasks`, `/cleaner/account` |
| 🟢 Green | **Supervisor** | `/supervisor/tasks`, `/supervisor/dispatch`, `/supervisor/reviews`, `/supervisor/workforce`, `/supervisor/onboard`, `/supervisor/account` |
| 🟣 Purple | **Admin / Master** | `/admin/overview`, `/admin/users`, `/admin/onboard`, `/admin/control`, `/admin/account` |

### Key Flows

1. **Login** → V1 `/users/login` → JWT → (if staff) V2 `/auth/exchange` → device token → RoleRoute → role dashboard
2. **Profile Edit** → `PATCH /users/me` (new endpoint, strict schema)
3. **Supervisor Dispatch** → `PATCH /supervisor/reports/:id/assign` + volunteer approve/decline
4. **Cleaner Tasks** → `PATCH /cleaner/tasks/:id/accept|reject|start|resolve`
4. **Admin User Mgmt** → `POST /admin/users/:id/roles` (supervisor|cleaner)

